        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bonadelle_Ranchos-Madera_Ranchos%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Sierra Nevada foothills rise just 7 miles northeast, offering rugged tabletop hills like Adobe Hill at 640 feet.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
